{
  "name": "Chronicle of the Raven Mother",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can place a corpse's hand or similar appendage on your Book of Shadows and ask one question aloud. After 1 minute, the answer appears written in blood in your book. The answer is provided by the dead creature's spirit to the best of its knowledge and is translated into a language of your choice. You must use this ability within 1 minute of a creature's death, and a given creature can only be asked one question in this manner.</p>",
